OL,3,GNEWSABoro legends return for 150th
OL,4,Aanniversary match
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost 100 former Middlesbrough players
OL,7,Fand managers are returning to Teesside
OL,8,Ffor a legacy game celebrating 150 years
OL,9,Fof the club.
OL,11,FA crowd of more than 30,000 are
OL,12,Fexpected at the Riverside Stadium to
OL,13,Fwatch club legends including Juninho,
OL,14,FFabrizio Ravanelli, Yakubu and Aitor
OL,15,FKaranka.
OL,17,FThe game will see two squads of former
OL,18,FBoro players go head-to-head, with
OL,19,Fothers featuring in a non-playing
OL,20,Fcapacity including a lap of honour and
OL,21,Fa presentation of legacy numbers.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
