OL,3,GNEWSABoro legends return for 150th
OL,4,Aanniversary match
OL,5,
OL,6,FMidfielder Geremi said he had been
OL,7,Ftraining for the spectacle, adding:
OL,8,F"I've not seen a lot of the guys for
OL,9,Fmany years, so it will be very exciting
OL,10,Fto see them and do what we used to do
OL,11,Ftogether - play football."
